to take it seriously and work hard, but everybody's--

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:48.970
Exactly!

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:53.600
When I heard our university had
men's cheerleading, I was so happy!

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:56.270
Although it wasn't at
the level I'd expected.

00:09:56.270 --> 00:10:00.850
